                "message": "🐛 Give emureader an explicit Elpaca recipe so it installs\n\nElpaca's cached GNU ELPA menu predates the rename to emureader, so\n`:ensure t` queued a recipe with no repository and failed in\nelpaca-git--fetch (wrong-type-argument stringp nil).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCdC2Z3W8k8foAG8mF",
